  :adr/decision-summary "{:pattern \"sealed AgMachTradeAdvisor + independent :ag-equipment-governor + append-only audit ledger, PRINCIPAL trading model with a PRODUCT-COMPLIANCE regulatory backbone (emissions + rollover-protection safety certification) -- a third trading-actor sub-pattern alongside commodity-provenance and trade-sanctions\", :new-actor \"cloud-itonami-isic-4653\", :org \"cloud-itonami\", :repo \"https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-4653\", :visibility :public, :license \"AGPL-3.0-or-later\", :isic-rev4 \"4653\", :isic-name \"Wholesale of agricultural machinery, equipment and supplies\", :registry-promotion \"kotoba-lang/industry registry.edn id 4653: :maturity :spec (dead gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-G4653 placeholder URL) -> :implemented (real repo)\", :namespace \"agmachtrade\", :independent-gates {:rationale \"generalizes isic-4651's two-failure-mode split further: two checks, each gated on its OWN independent boolean, not one enum or one folded rule\", :checks [{:check :emissions-certificate-missing, :gate :engine-powered?} {:check :rops-certification-missing, :gate :ride-on?}], :proof-of-independence \"a stationary engine-driven irrigation-pump unit (engine-powered, NOT ride-on) holds on emissions-certificate-missing only; a towed implement (neither engine-powered nor ride-on) is a true NO-OP on both checks, dispatching cleanly despite neither cert on file\"}, :governor-checks [{:check :no-spec-basis :severity :hard} {:check :evidence-incomplete :severity :hard} {:check :credit-uncleared :severity :hard} {:check :contract-missing :severity :hard} {:check :emissions-certificate-missing :severity :hard} {:check :rops-certification-missing :severity :hard} {:check :counterparty-sanctions-flag-unresolved :severity :hard} {:check :already-dispatched :severity :hard} {:check :already-invoiced :severity :hard} {:check :high-stakes-actuation-gate :severity :soft-escalate}], :robotics {:value false, :key-present false, :rationale \"the entity :delivery/dispatch actually gates (tractor/combine/implement) is driven or towed off the lot by a human operator in real practice; no fixed apparatus exists to gate a robot command against. Real automated parts-inventory retrieval at large dealer groups was explicitly considered and REJECTED as a basis for :robotics true, since it gates a DIFFERENT entity than this actor's governed op -- second fleet example (after isic-4651) of explicitly rejecting a robotics claim rather than defaulting to a recent sibling's value\"}, :r0-scope {:source-catalog [\"USA EPA 40 CFR Part 1039 (nonroad diesel Tier 1-4 Final, Engine Family certification)\" \"USA OSHA 29 CFR 1928.51 (ROPS required on ag tractors manufactured after 1976-10-25, SAE J2194/ASABE S519 referenced)\" \"USA OFAC\" \"EU (DEU representative) Regulation (EU) 2016/1628 (Stage V nonroad emissions)\" \"EU Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230, repeals Directive 2006/42/EC effective 2027-01-20 -- exact date independently re-verified via WebSearch at ADR-authoring time, resolving the implementing agent's flagged uncertainty\"], :citations-verified \"all citations independently re-verified via WebSearch at ADR-authoring time, including the precise 2027-01-20 repeal date; OECD Code 4/ISO 3471 scope details remain flagged lower-confidence by the implementing agent\", :store-backend \"MemStore + DatomicStore (langchain.db), same swap-seam as siblings\"}, :test-results {:unit-tests \"38 tests / 192 assertions, 0 failures\", :lint \"0 errors, 0 warnings\", :demo \"clojure -M:dev:run verified end-to-end: clean ride-on+engine-powered lifecycle, emissions-only hold (stationary engine unit), rops-only hold (implied by independent gating), towed-implement true no-op on both checks\"}, :registration-note \"industry main advanced past this branch's base with a concurrent promotion (ISIC 3811) before merge, causing a textual conflict on the maturity-count test line (both bumped independently to 132). Resolved via re-branch from fresh kotoba-lang/main + cherry-pick (not local rebase/force), count corrected to 133 = 132 (3811) + 1 (4653).\", :manifest-registration \"none -- standalone, per the existing cloud-itonami-{ISIC} blueprint convention. Only kotoba-lang/industry pin advanced in manifest/west.yml (nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry industry, minimal diff)\"}"
